cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TJSP Fiscal Execution Dataset (CEMEPI / Gilson)"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
- family-names: Braga
  given-names: Etore
repository-code: "https://github.com/Etore-BeS/habitual-tax-debtor-research"
abstract: >
  Large-scale dataset of fiscal execution proceedings from the São Paulo State Court of Justice (TJSP), covering ~6.1 million decisions across ~5.8 million unique processes. Includes decision text, case metadata, financial records, and party information scraped from the FACE/TJSP system.
keywords:
- jurimetrics
- fiscal execution
- court data
- TJSP
- empirical legal studies
- Brazil
